   "text": "ok, I want the money back on the company card, not credit. Go with the card refund for the tacos and the burrito. I used the code OFFICE16 but I don't remember how much it took off, so I'm not sure those numbers are right. Also, I'm still unpacking and found more stuff. One of the cheese quesadillas is a chicken one, and only 2 of the 3 chips and guac came. Can you check those too?"
