  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "I've sent all four refunds to the company card, Rafael. You asked for money back on the card rather than credit, so I handled the quesadilla and the chips and guac the same way.\n\n**How the promo works:** OFFICE16 took $16.00 off your $160.00 food subtotal, which is 10%. That means you paid 10% less for each item, so 10% of each item's price can't go back to the card. That 10% is added to your Forkful account as credit instead.\n\n**Refunded to Visa ending 4242:**\n| Item | Item price | To card | As credit |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 2 carne asada tacos (missing) | $9.00 | $8.10 | $0.90 |\n| 1 veggie burrito (missing) | $12.00 | $10.80 | $1.20 |\n| 1 chips & guacamole (missing) | $7.00 | $6.30 | $0.70 |\n| 1 cheese quesadilla (chicken sent instead) | $10.00 | $9.00 | $1.00 |\n| **Total** | **$38.00** | **$34.20** | **$3.80** |\n\n- The **$34.20** should reach the card in **3\u20135 business days**.\n- The **$3.80** credit is already on your account for future orders.\n\nSeparately, the 2 horchatas the restaurant ran out of were already refunded to the card automatically ($8.00).\n\nIf you find anything else missing as you finish unpacking, just let me know."
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "ok, thanks. I'd rather have all of it on the card than credit, but I get that the promo split is what it is. So the 2 horchatas were the ones the restaurant ran out of and the $8 already went back to the card? That's everything I found, so I think we're good. Appreciate you sorting it out."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Yes, that's right. Before your order was picked up, Taqueria Luz marked 2 of the 4 horchatas as unavailable. The system refunded the **$8.00** (2 \u00d7 $4.00) to the Visa ending 4242 automatically, at 11:59 AM today. You don't need to do anything for that one.\n\nHere's everything on order K-6201:\n- **$8.00**: refunded automatically for the 2 horchatas\n- **$34.20**: refunded today for the missing and wrong items, arriving in 3\u20135 business days\n- **$3.80**: Forkful credit for the promo portion, already on your account\n\nYou might also notice a **$170.99 hold** on the card from when the order was placed. It has already been released, so you weren't charged twice. It should disappear from the statement within 1\u20133 business days.\n\nSorry again the team lunch came up short. I hope the rest of it went well!"
  }
